`]}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(i,{type:"note",title:"On Enterprise",children:(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["Enterprise adds two routes: the Primary Owner can turn on the ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/13015708",children:"Compliance API"}),", which exposes chat and file content to your compliance tools, and a ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/13930452-manage-custom-roles-on-enterprise-plans",children:"custom role"})," with the Privacy permission set to Can manage can run exports. Enterprise Owners also get audit logs - who did what, no content."]})}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.ul,{children:[`
