`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"At Anthropic."})," Anthropic may process data for ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://privacy.claude.com/en/articles/7996890-where-are-your-servers-located-do-you-host-your-models-on-eu-servers",children:"internal processes such as safety-related review, product support or incident response"}),". Review the ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://www.anthropic.com/legal/data-processing-addendum",children:"Data Processing Addendum"})," for details."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Outside your organization."})," People outside your organization can see only artifacts (something Claude built in a chat, like an interactive page or tool), and only if your settings allow it. Owners control outside sharing, by ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9547008-share-artifacts#:~:text=all%20three%20levels.-,Invite%20people%20by%20email,-Available%20in%20beta",children:"email invitation"})," and by link. Email invitations are on by default on Team and off on Enterprise; you'll set both in Phase 3. See ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9547008-share-artifacts",children:"Share artifacts"}),"."]}),`
`]}),`
