`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["Before you write anything, find out what's already happening. Leadership and staff usually see AI use differently, and NTEN and The Bridgespan Group's ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://www.nten.org/publications/state-of-nonprofit-ai",children:"State of Nonprofit AI Adoption and Governance report (2026)"})," describes the gap. A short check-in closes most of it and gives you raw material for the policy."]}),`
