`,(0,n.jsx)(s,{children:(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:(0,n.jsxs)(r.em,{children:["Our Claude account is on Anthropic's [Team/Enterprise] plan. Under Anthropic's commercial terms, by default our conversations and files are not used to train AI models and aren't visible to colleagues unless we share them. Our Primary Owner can export all conversations[; on Enterprise: and our compliance tools can access them through the Compliance API]. Anthropic may process them for internal processes such as safety-related review, product support or incident response (see Anthropic's ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://www.anthropic.com/legal/data-processing-addendum",children:"Data Processing Addendum"}),"). They're covered by Anthropic's Commercial Terms of Service (or our organization's agreement with Anthropic) [link]. The feedback buttons are [on/off]; [if on: don't submit feedback on conversations that contain client or donor details]."]})})}),`
